---

## 5. Observable Features

Observable market variables include

- OFI
- Main Flow
- VWAP Deviation
- Price Impact
- Relative Volume

These variables are not institutional positions.

Instead,

they are observable consequences of institutional trading activity.

---

## 6. Emission Distribution

A hidden state does not produce one deterministic observation.

Instead,

each hidden state generates a distribution of possible observations.

Example

Accumulation may produce

- Positive OFI
- Positive Main Flow
- Positive Price Impact

but not always.

Noise is a natural part of market observations.

---

## 7. Evidence Integration

Individual features may conflict.

Example

